================================================================================
                            1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

1.1  "Software" refers to the Ministry of Groove NCC Master v5.2.3, including
     all source code, object code, documentation, databases, configurations,
     and associated materials.

1.2  "Licensor" refers to Ministry of Groove, the exclusive owner of all
     intellectual property rights in the Software.

1.3  "Authorized User" refers to personnel explicitly granted access by the
     Licensor, holding valid security clearance and operational need.

1.4  "Classified Information" refers to all data, protocols, and operational
     details contained within or accessible through the Software.

================================================================================
                         2. OWNERSHIP AND COPYRIGHT
